  "description": "According to prophecy, only wisdom—or “Ji-Hye”—can heal the division tearing the Moon Kingdom apart. Doo-Shik, the youngest prince of the rabbits, leaves the moon to find Ji-Hye and save his kingdom. Immediately upon arriving on Earth, he encounters Ji-Hye Seo, a young man on a quest of his own. Ji-Hye’s quest... is to find big D. Can the duo overcome lies, disapproving family, and constantly getting distracted by the bedroom to rescue the moon?!\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
